        "content": "As of the May 1, 2026 run, JNJ's confirmed daily downtrend is intact and has evolved as expected: price bounced from the $224.86 low (April 29) to $229.85 (April 30 close), reaching exactly the 10-EMA resistance zone flagged in the prior run. Daily RSI has recovered from deeply oversold (28.35) to 36.5 \u2014 less extreme, consistent with a counter-trend bounce rather than a trend reversal. ADX at 30.72 (up from 29.46) confirms the downtrend is strengthening. Hourly Bollinger Band width of 0.029 (extremely tight squeeze at resistance) indicates the next directional move is imminent. The short entry zone ($229\u2013231) remains the active setup. (Source: swing_head_trader signal, decisions.json, signals_combined.json, run 20260501_194523.)\n\n**Prior setup archived.** The Apr 30 state had RSI 28.35 (deeply oversold), ADX 29.46. RSI has recovered to 36.5, and ADX has risen slightly to 30.72. The EMA stack is unchanged \u2014 still fully bearish. The 10-EMA resistance zone thesis from the prior run has been validated: price is now trading there.",
